# `make symlinks` links the firmware into a config's bin/ directory so that a
# single -L suffices. Those links are a local convenience, never content: this
# repo once carried them committed and absolute, which left 55 dangling links
# in every clone made outside /git/md. Keeping them unstageable makes that
# impossible to repeat.
#
# The real firmware lives in fw_blobs/, and the pristine copies under
# bin/_reference/ are tracked -- .gitignore does not affect already-tracked
# files, so those are unaffected.
bin/**/nvram1
bin/**/openboot.bin
bin/**/q.bin
bin/**/reset.bin
bin/**/netcons
